<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GUD half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GUD half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		9.5 vs   9.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		     9.13 vs   5.80</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    14.59 vs   8.96</p>
<p>NOTE: G.U.D. Holdings Ltd is a manufacturer of automotive parts.  </p>
<p>    Sales			  147.03 vs  67.04</p>
<p>    Other income		   0.59 vs   0.30</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   17.2  vs  15.2</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 15</p>
<p>Reg date March 21</p>
<p>    Tax				5.47 vs   3.16</p>
<p>    Interest			 2.60 vs   1.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   3.34 vs   1.55</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
